With alpha unknown (prior mean about 0.48), tight quotes lose too much to informed traders on the extreme outcomes. Averaged over the three alpha values, an ask of 16 is slightly negative, while 18 and 19 each earn about +0.107 per side. I pick 18 and 8 over 19 and 7 because the expected profit is the same but an informed trader can still trade at 18/8 (on a 19 or a 7), which tells me a little about alpha.

