At that mean, the expected profit per side is about the same anywhere from 18 to 19 on the ask (about 0.10), and falls off quickly inside 18 as informed losses grow. An ask of 19 and a bid of 7 can never be hit by an informed trader, so they collect only the noise-trader edge of 6 per fill with no adverse selection. The distribution is symmetric about 13, so the same holds for the bid.

